# Route pitch — the race (route A), throttle held for ~1500 vblanks (the car runs the straight, no crash), then idle; for tools/mod_rollover_check.sh --pitch
# (the rollover mod's pitch limit: GT_MOD_ROLLOVER_FAKE_PITCH writes a nose-up pitch rate while the car drives; without the limit the nose goes
# vertical and the car spins like a top). `rollover.pad` up to the race start, then a shorter drive: no barrier hit.
